{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301081","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301081","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1430108101:1":{"text":"俺の鍛造道具たちさ……最近ご機嫌斜めで、作業に支障が出てる。","source_cn":"是我用来锻造的工具们，它们最近在闹别扭，这很影响我干活...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B92C916727FA0B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430108102:1":{"text":"こんな時こそヘクト様に祈って、讃歌を歌うのよ。きっと仲直りできるわ。","source_cn":"这种时候你应该向赫托祈祷，唱起赫托颂歌让工具们和好如初。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FFD124301EB33BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1430108103:1":{"text":"ヘクト様に感謝を！火山を窯となし、土をダイヤに変えた！ヘクト様の下、ふいごは火を起こし、鉱石は真の姿となる！","source_cn":"感谢赫托！他以火山为炉，将泥土炼成钻石。在他的教授下，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60B2D630EA2EEA8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1430108104:1":{"text":"ヘクト様を讃えよ！絶えぬ窯火こそ、我らの誇り。窯火が燃え続ける限り、ヘクト様の名は不滅なり！","source_cn":"赞美赫托！世上不灭的炉，是他于人间的坛。我们锤铸于炉边...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D33660A57EC3868","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:工匠石拳":{"text":"職人のロックフィスト","source":"工匠石拳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:工匠凯蕾莎":{"text":"職人のカイレーシャ","source":"工匠凯蕾莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}